            "review_title": "Review at Thanh Long Bakery & Cafe",
            "review_text": "Clinton W\n16 contributions\n0\nCroissantiful\nJul 2017 • Couples\nSmall bakery in the Old Quarter run by a delightful woman who was genuinely pleased when she saw us back a second and third time. \n\nSuper friendly. \n\nOne of the best croissant (only 20000 dong) I've had anywhere - buttery, soft and full of flavour. \n\nGreat place for a quick bread-y refuel or to fill up your backpack with provisions for a long bus or train trip!\nRead more\nWritten July 12, 2017",
